<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>香港低生育率低惹关注 马斯克警告港人将消失  评论：是优质港人消失</b><br/><br/>曾在港工作的前投资银行家约翰拉斐尔发帖谈AI，赞扬昔日香港同事教育水平高、聪明、勤奋且充满上进心。科技富豪马斯克却将焦点转向香港低生育率问题，警告若情况不改变，香港人很快便会消失，言论成为网络热话。<br/><br/>港府暂未就马斯克言论作回应，曾建议港府强制用“不合格避孕套”提高生育率的商人施永青，反驳马斯克的说法，又指没有人能为何谓香港人下定义。中港网民均加入讨论，但关注重点大不相同。<br/><br/>有评论认为，真正值得关注的，并非香港人口数字会否归零，而是昔日具竞争力及国际视野的香港人，正逐渐消失。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E9%A9%AC%E6%96%AF%E5%85%8B">#马斯克</a> <a href="?q=%23%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF">#香港</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%87%BA%E7%94%9F%E7%8E%87">#出生率</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A">#社会</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>X：<a href="https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2122216166584435079" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">Elon Musk回复</a><br/>《文汇报》<a href="https://www.facebook.com/wenweipo/posts/%E9%A6%AC%E6%96%AF%E5%85%8B%E9%97%9C%E6%B3%A8%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%87%BA%E7%94%9F%E7%8E%87%E4%BD%8E%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E7%B9%BC%E7%BA%8C%E4%BB%96%E5%80%91%E5%BE%88%E5%BF%AB%E6%9C%83%E6%B6%88%E5%A4%B1%E7%89%B9%E6%96%AF%E6%8B%89%E5%8F%8Aspacex%E8%A1%8C%E6%94%BF%E7%B8%BD%E8%A3%81%E9%A6%AC%E6%96%AF%E5%85%8Belon-musk%E6%98%A8%E6%97%A516%E6%97%A5%E5%9C%A8%E7%A4%BE%E4%BA%A4%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0x%E5%9B%9E%E6%87%89%E4%B8%80%E5%89%87%E8%AB%87%E5%8F%8A%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%96%E6%96%87%E6%99%82%E6%8C%87%E5%87%BA%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%95%B7%E6%9C%9F%E4%BB%A5/1791112403017409/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">马斯克关注香港出生率低：“如果情况继续他们很快会消失”</a><br/>《联合报》<a href="https://udn.com/news/story/7331/9883016" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">马斯克警告香港人再不生恐消失！少子化不只香港连印度也陷生育危机</a><br/>《香港01》<a href="https://www.hk01.com/article/60411689?utm_source=01articlecopy&amp;amp;utm_medium=referral" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">施永青反驳Elon Musk香港出生率论不严谨：根本毋须关心港生育率</a><br/>《法广》<a href="https://www.rfi.fr/tw/%E6%B8%AF%E6%BE%B3%E5%8F%B0/20261117-%E5%89%8D%E9%8A%80%E8%A1%8C%E5%AE%B6%E8%88%87%E9%A6%AC%E6%96%AF%E5%85%8B%E9%9A%94%E7%A9%BA%E8%AB%87%E6%B8%AF%E4%BA%BA%E8%B3%AA%E9%87%8F%E5%BC%95%E7%99%BC%E7%86%B1%E8%AD%B0-%E8%A9%95%E8%AB%96%E6%8C%87%E5%BE%80%E6%98%94%E6%9C%89%E7%B4%A0%E8%B3%AA%E6%B8%AF%E4%BA%BA%E6%AD%A3%E6%B6%88%E5%A4%B1" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">前银行家与马斯克隔空谈港人质量引发热议评论指往昔有素质港人正消失</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/fFRn355B42SJhOtestqnLM-o2VARvy-kVso1L56JbtWspwzUW4ZCDJkEMUvgnf7PXW_699LvERwuW7kpg_WZ_YsfGbAf_oRPLKD1qC1if-ewY1cCd3-YrAkshuUo1x65XvCgIwcTFd_lKJieX6ndBAU_CU_E13jM4we6qwjhu5Mnf-T7Bl9CZHl5xKpjI9paRfYmTWjprxfWzus2Fy9KzzH8Ssh0JomGPMRFUBcBaZA9fqJsSH8LsRKfBGnAlFQ1MO0Yu-a6XdG9ZBMWkjqYb911AFs_kka_GQJGuyDAfaiHSb6scZvIJp_cYhCkkiG7JrR6xRxWN7KSPvdTHk8V4g.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/QK46k7cyhNq4NKTWs7lE-KiSTCZX9JySRhXQt_oiFncmSDhfJq8EaT5IITmTH-HJ2UVrbEI5omCTsOOlLImchMAFit41fhYn2WfaVyTg53YCgrAckcoHlGHvCF11i5IJjCr1YdvUIZm0ZJRVj6cCAqJo7r7xFyhjyQ5s5bhWaxIngD_IsqOa0EhEhdGga2VwSrNvPxMjLXBoa69W0ugFH6wZCB3JhPmcsXl0abrOAMaVebj_ad5oyFtPCcOGMeAAzS0fdXWa4Vd425mjrKpe10qTXaBI-NxJRdHRmEURtn91V4GEXZtS3qAsw-ko_swEiHXpiyhBmABHZJ0i4hsbQA.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/sF15nWBy8oWO2GJ5EqUtgyqkCofqFbaBw5Nc8VvjaOubyK_X2gRCIiQVmWxPCXRu4TTjadUbpiwYhZqKHuDQhWJx86bY-sr9AJxeswKLjir9UhZsQ2lDOESW-syDpGfWd-U4bvE4FL_T5-3aV-r0tUkSQvr--vTPNIUTdBt1mmw9R39j0KvVEqQ06K1Bb0gzjmt6uMr1QcrBiXsTs4-WJRSTcjXCg8E-iRkxZewbR-9k-u7EaxXbjQ0o0hjOtLSkjB-4zeGK-8RgE-p3VjmXT2LC-Q2O1mDsDYSaapfuKX7MG_SdTBxQQUW9lyKIt9dU8Hhg4a8W2AkXySW2hiqL3g.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" s